  "description": "Former idol-turned-actor Ha Yeong-won. Defying public doubt, Yeong-won makes a brilliant career shift and grows into a respected “serious actor.” His next challenge: the lead role in a queer film. His co-star? None other than the top actor he admires most—Sung Jae-jun! Determined not to fall short of Jae-jun’s professionalism, Yeong-won throws himself into his role and even steps into a gay bar to better understand his character… only to run into Jae-jun there as well. Yeong-won assumes, of course, that Jae-jun is there for the same reason—for acting. But Jae-jun seems to have come for something else entirely… As the two grow closer at a rapid pace, one question remains—will their relationship end with the performance, or go beyond the script?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/short_act), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/no_eternal_performance), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066307), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11762991)",
